project_specification.addition_summary:
Run a live exploration campaign end to end: the inner loop of
docs/alpha-engine-prd.md section 5 and docs/nullius-tech-architecture.md.
It builds on spec A (additions_spec_live_evaluation.xml: the
orchestrator member and its "live-evaluator" component) and on
additions_spec_llm_authoring.xml (the "signal-author" component). It
adds the pieces nothing has yet:
- root planting: a root is an authored opening signal at depth 0, in a
  freshly assigned theme;
- Type-R null sealing at the right moment;
- a live CampaignTree view for the exploration policy;
- the exploration policy itself: the admitted incumbent policy module,
  with a built-in baseline when none is configured;
- the expand, record, evaluate and persist worker;
- the round loop with its stopping rules, and the campaign finish;
- a command, `python -m orchestrator.campaign`.
